{"tagline":"Ayurvedic Brain \u0026 Learning Support Protein Blend for Children (150 g)","intro":["A nutrition-rich protein blend formulated with Brahmi, Shankh Pushpi, Mulethi, and Kesar to naturally boost memory, focus, and cognitive development in children. Promotes emotional growth, mental alertness, and learning skills while strengthening brain health."],"sec":[{"t":"Benefits","p":[],"li":["Boosts memory \u0026 concentration","Enhances cognitive brain function","Supports mental alertness naturally","Promotes emotional \u0026 social development","Strengthens learning \u0026 focus skills"]},{"t":"How to use","p":["Take 1 teaspoon twice daily with milk or as directed by the physician."],"li":[]},{"t":"Ingredients","p":[],"li":["Brahmi (Bacopa monnieri) – 14 g","Shankh Pushpi (Convolvulus pluricaulis) – 14 g","Vaca (Acorus calamus) – 12 g","Mulethi (Glycyrrhiza glabra) – 12 g","Satavari (Asparagus racemosus) – 10 g","Vayvidanga (Embelia ribes) – 8 g","Vidhara (Argyreia nervosa) – 8 g","Gulab Phool (Rosa centifolia) – 8 g","Amalaki (Emblica officinalis) – 6 g","Saunf (Foeniculum vulgare) – 3 g","Dalchini (Cinnamomum zeylanicum) – 1.5 g","Choti Elaichi (Elettaria cardamomum) – 1.5 g","Nagakesar (Mesua ferrea) – 1 g","Akarkara (Anacyclus pyrethrum) – 0.99 g","Kesar (Crocus sativus) – 0.01 g"]},{"t":"Packaging","p":["150 g Herbal Protein Blend"],"li":[]}],"full":"Shishu Mind Boost Protein"}